        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          160 'Khamhpui Tingmik Naaguang pwthe.",
            "                                8.8.8.8. Ref. 9.9. 10.8",
            "",
            "          1. 'Khamhpui tingmik naaguang pwthe,",
            "             Zinghmei tei guang zaic pwni the;",
            "             Paapc kandic tei twan pwkhou kiu,",
            "             Heic kandic ta ning dat lak khe.",
            "",
            "                  Lwmloumei guay adih zaenggay ni -",
            "                  Tingklauh kandic guangtanghpui nungc kiu!",
            "                  Kapmei, ryanraamei, 'tamvmei nai lak khe;",
            "                  Tingsaeng zaeng Pou' ta thuancbam 'ni.",
            "",
            "          2. Kakwm kaganv hei ningzauc lo,",
            "             Ramh kaguayna kalaic ngam the;",
            "             Kabamv 'thuih khou siimei khwan rui,",
            "             Guang pwthe mi kandic khouhei.",
            "",
            "          3. Kaipouc tuang tingmik guang mak khou,",
            "             Kaganv rui nai bammei lungc khou;",
            "             Nang bumaengc ringh khang phu la tho.",
            "             Kaipouc tei guang zaic pwni the."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
